            "value": "選んだもの"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude asks a question, waits for its plan to be approved, or a tool’s form waits for you. From Claude Code’s PreToolUse hook (AskUserQuestion, ExitPlanMode), its Elicitation hook, and its Notification hook (elicitation_dialog).": {
      "comment": "Settings › Alerts: where an event comes from",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claudeが質問している、計画の承認を待っている、またはツールのフォームが入力を待っています。Claude CodeのPreToolUseフック（AskUserQuestion、ExitPlanMode）、Elicitationフック、Notificationフック（elicitation_dialog）から届きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude asks to use a tool. From Claude Code’s PermissionRequest hook, and its Notification hook (permission_prompt).": {
      "comment": "Settings › Alerts: where an event comes from",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
