    "Now and then an idle cat wanders the grass near its blanket, and runs home the moment Claude has work. Settings › Meadow can keep cats on their blankets.": {
      "comment": "Help page: idle cats wander",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暇な猫はときどきブランケットの近くの草むらを歩き回り、Claude に仕事が入るとすぐに駆け戻ります。設定の「草原」で猫をブランケットにとどめておけます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
